IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "At the POKéMON LEAGUE, you will\n"
    .string "face the ELITE FOUR all in a row.\p"
    .string "If you lose, you have to start all\n"
    .string "over again!\p"
    .string "This is it!\n"
    .string "Go for it!$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FaceEliteFourGoodLuck::
    .string "From here on, you face the\n"
    .string "ELITE FOUR one by one.\p"
    .string "If you win, a door opens to the\n"
    .string "next TRAINER. Good luck!$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LoreleiIsAbsentClosedForTimeBeing::
    .string "I am so sorry, but you've wasted\n"
    .string "your time coming here.\p"
    .string "LORELEI of the ELITE FOUR is\n"
    .string "absent, you see.\p"
    .string "As a result, the POKéMON LEAGUE is\n"
    .string "closed for the time being.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_AgathaWhuppedUs::
    .string "AGATHA's GHOST-type POKéMON are\n"
    .string "horrifically terrifying in toughness.\p"
    .string "I took my FIGHTING-type POKéMON\n"
    .string "and raised them to the max.\p"
    .string "I went at AGATHA feeling pretty\n"
    .string "confident, but she whupped us.\p"
    .string "That old lady's also got a really\n"
    .string "short fuse, too.\p"
    .string "It doesn't take anything to get\n"
    .string "that scary lady hollering.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LancesCousinGymLeaderFarAway::
    .string "Maybe becoming an ELITE FOUR\n"
    .string "member is in the blood.\p"
    .string "From what I've heard, LANCE has\n"
    .string "a cousin who's a GYM LEADER\l"
    .string "somewhere far away.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BriceBefore::
    .string "BRICE: Hey, {PLAYER}. Still standing,\n"
    .string "as you can see.\p"
    .string "At HEMATEK the boss beat all three\n"
    .string "of us with one POKéMON each.\p"
    .string "I will not fight again. I will\n"
    .string "cheer from the stands.\p"
    .string "Win this tournament for us!$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BriceAfter::
    .string "BRICE: CHAMPION! Hah, I knew it.\p"
    .string "Whatever that man wanted, he did\n"
    .string "not get it. Not from you.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FloraBefore::
    .string "FLORA: {PLAYER}! You came all the way\n"
    .string "to the PLATEAU.\p"
    .string "My POKéMON are healed, and so is\n"
    .string "my pride. Mostly.\p"
    .string "The boss will come for the prize,\n"
    .string "I am sure of it. Be careful.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FloraAfter::
    .string "FLORA: You did it, CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "I saw the end from the stands.\n"
    .string "Be proud of that wish, whichever\lone you make.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MistyBefore::
    .string "MISTY: Oh, it is you!\p"
    .string "I heard whispers in the stands.\n"
    .string "The winner of this tournament\p"
    .string "gets to meet JIRACHI. A wish for\n"
    .string "whoever stands at the top.\p"
    .string "ONYBRIS would not miss that.\n"
    .string "Watch your back out there!$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MistyAfter::
    .string "MISTY: CHAMPION! I am so proud.\p"
    .string "Come see me at the CERULEAN\n"
    .string "cottage when you have a moment.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsIntro::
    .string "FLORA: You hold the six legends now.\n"
    .string "Eight GYM LEADERS refuse to bow.\p"
    .string "They call themselves the REBELS and\n"
    .string "they have trained hard since.\p"
    .string "Will you face them? I will heal your\n"
    .string "team before each duel.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsContinue::
    .string "FLORA: The next REBEL is waiting.\n"
    .string "Shall we?$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsNo::
    .string "FLORA: Take your time. They will\n"
    .string "wait. Rebels are patient.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelDefeat::
    .string "REBEL: Hmph. Even so, we kneel...\n"
    .string "to nobody. We just lost.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsWon::
    .string "FLORA: One REBEL down. Take these\n"
    .string "RARE CANDIES. Come back when ready.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsFinal::
    .string "FLORA: Eight REBELS, four of the\n"
    .string "old LEAGUE, and the three MASTERS.\p"
    .string "Fifteen duels, and none of them\n"
    .string "hates you for it.\p"
    .string "Rule wisely, CHAMPION. This is a\n"
    .string "gift from the whole LEAGUE.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsDone::
    .string "FLORA: The REBELS keep their gyms\n"
    .string "and their pride. Peace holds.\p"
    .string "The THRONE MARKET is open to you,\n"
    .string "CHAMPION of all.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsStage1::
    .string "FLORA: The eight REBELS are down.\n"
    .string "Take these. You earned them.\p"
    .string "The THRONE MARKET opens for you.\n"
    .string "Ask me when you wish to shop.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsCourt::
    .string "FLORA: The old LEAGUE wants to test\n"
    .string "the one who rules the six legends.\p"
    .string "LORELEI, BRUNO, AGATHA and LANCE.\n"
    .string "Ready?$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsStage2::
    .string "FLORA: The four of the LEAGUE have\n"
    .string "bowed. One step left.\p"
    .string "The three MASTERS are waiting.$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RebelsMasters::
    .string "FLORA: GOLD, SILVER and GIOVANNI.\n"
    .string "They trained for this day.\p"
    .string "Shall I call them?$"

IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MarketAsk::
    .string "FLORA: Do you wish to visit the\n"
    .string "THRONE MARKET?$"
